Run post-setup diagnostics for the Kubernetes distribution, MCP Runtime services, registry, image pulls, Sentinel dependencies, authentication, and MCPServer reconciliation. Each failure includes a targeted remediation. Setup already runs a shorter operational smoke gate (nodes, PVCs, Postgres, platform-api, Sentinel rollouts, auth probe); use this command for deeper follow-up.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime cluster diagnostics [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for diagnostics

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
